; certification, and migrates to another jurisdiction, where he finds a job. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/5527811329904598263'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/5527811329904598263'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html?showComment=1473688705262#c5527811329904598263' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='//3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1670979810563971746' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1670979810563971746' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 7:58 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6337220099490897377</id><published>2016-09-12T07:22:30.107-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T07:22:30.107-06:00</updated><title type='text'>while i think i understand the term, would you ple...</title><content type='html'>while i think i understand the term, would you please define &amp;#39;gypsy cop&amp;#39; so there will be no question in my mind as to what this term &lt;br /&gt;means?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;i want to know where the &amp;#39;gypsy cop&amp;#39; will be harassing and murdering citizens, as well.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;thanks.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/6337220099490897377'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/6337220099490897377'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html?showComment=1473686550107#c6337220099490897377' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1670979810563971746' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1670979810563971746' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1888487452"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 7:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4857046481457887142</id><published>2016-09-09T12:19:28.009-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-09T12:19:28.009-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Lets take this to a different angle on just how wr...</title><content type='html'>Lets take this to a different angle on just how wrong the whole criminal justice system is. Cathy Woods is not out of the thick of it and never will be because the FBI will have a file on her that any LE person can get that states she has been charged and convicted of murder. This in fact is what the FBI does in keeping and share records of innocent people that had been unlucky to have crooked cops and government lawyers charge them with crimes that they did not commit. The judge dismisses the charges but the FBI keeps the records and share them with any LE that wants them. This causes huge problems for crime victims of criminals in the &amp;quot;justice&amp;quot; system. These dishonest records need to be removed and destroyed  by the FBI. But they are not and it take ten&amp;#39;s of thousands of dollars for a victim of these records to retain a lawyer and go to federal court to have them removed and they may not get them removed. &lt;br /&gt;The pain of the criminals in the criminal justice system that are criminal cops and criminal government lawyers is something that never goes away. Proof by the FBI records of NCIC on innocent citizens is a demeanor of Us vs Them that taxes are paying for. &lt;br /&gt;The demeanor is also the government employees attitude that if a person is charged they are guilty or the cops would never have charged them in the first place. In the 80&amp;#39;s the AG of the US directly said that is the case. &lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/4857046481457887142'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/4857046481457887142'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html?showComment=1473445168009#c4857046481457887142' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1670979810563971746' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1670979810563971746' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-215191915"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 9, 2016 at 12:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3981042533383681845</id><published>2016-09-09T11:38:44.888-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-09T11:38:44.888-06:00</updated><title type='text'>those with power and without a conscience are show...</title><content type='html'>those with power and without a conscience are shown, again, to be the most dangerous among us.  sadly, this is what has become of us with our tolerance and, therefore, support.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/3981042533383681845'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/3981042533383681845'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html?showComment=1473442724888#c3981042533383681845' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1670979810563971746' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1670979810563971746' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1477838144"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 9, 2016 at 11:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2773102180136020797</id><published>2016-09-09T08:19:05.107-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-09T08:19:05.107-06:00</updated><title type='text'>That should mean the death penalty for the corrupt...</title><content type='html'>That should mean the death penalty for the corrupt filth with law licenses who act as assassins for the state.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/2773102180136020797'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/2773102180136020797'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html?showComment=1473430745107#c2773102180136020797' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/the-stolen-life-of-cathy-woods.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1670979810563971746' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1670979810563971746' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1294269079"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 9, 2016 at 8:19 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7111791828995777386</id><published>2016-09-08T19:49:43.880-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-08T19:49:43.880-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Not sure qualified immunity extends to protection ...</title><content type='html'>Not sure qualified immunity extends to protection from willful forgery or manufacturing of evidence, fyi. If admissible evidence of those facts come up, almost certain the QI defense won&amp;#39;t exist. Here&amp;#39;s hoping for some &amp;quot;restorative justice.&amp;quot; Good writing.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1670979810563971746/comments/default/7111791828995777